    "intro_narrative": "The underground server farm of the shadowy Vanguard Corporation is eerily quiet, save for the low hum of cooling fans. You are an elite cyber-operative tasked with a singular mission: extract the master ledger containing the corporation's global blackmail targets. The facility has initiated a lockdown protocol, and you have only minutes before the server racks are wiped clean by an automated EMP. Before you stands a complex array of interconnected systems: humming mainframes, encrypted archives, and advanced network interfaces. You must navigate this physical maze of digital security, carefully tracing the data flows from one machine to the next, to isolate and extract the target file. The clock is ticking, and the digital tripwires are live.",
